o<m107_remap> sub
; M107 — deploy the Marposs touch probe (pneumatic linear actuator mounted
; next to the HSK63F spindle, not carried in a tool holder). Energizes
; digital-out-12; see io.hal for the solenoid-sense caveat (assumed
; energized = deployed). The G4 dwell is a placeholder settle time standing
; in for a real "probe deployed" confirmation input — there isn't one wired
; yet (same pattern as the ATC drawbar in return_tool.ngc/fetch_tool.ngc).
; See README.md "Workpiece Touch Probe (Marposs)".
M64 P12
G4 P0.5
o<m107_remap> endsub
